  "raw_text": "{\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"python_programs/next_palindrome.py\",\"new_content\":\"def next_palindrome(digit_list):\\n    n = len(digit_list)\\n    # next palindrome strictly greater than the current one\\n    # work on a copy and only mirror once we know the increment location\\n    for i in range((n - 1) // 2, -1, -1):\\n        if digit_list[i] < 9:\\n            digit_list[i] += 1\\n            mirror_index = n - 1 - i\\n            if mirror_index != i:\\n                digit_list[mirror_index] = digit_list[i]\\n            # reset all inner digits (between i and mirror) to 0\\n            for j in range(i + 1, n - 1 - i):\\n                digit_list[j] = 0\\n            return digit_list\\n        else:\\n            digit_list[i] = 0\\n            mirror_index = n - 1 - i\\n            if mirror_index != i:\\n                digit_list[mirror_index] = 0\\n    # all digits were 9 -> number grows by one digit\\n    result = [1] + [0] * n + [1]\\n    for i in range(n):\\n        digit_list[i] = 0\\n    return result\\n\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nFinds the next palindromic integer when given the current integer\\nIntegers are stored as arrays of base 10 digits from most significant to least significant\\n\\nInput:\\n    digit_list: An array representing the current palindrome\\n\\nOutput:\\n    An array which represents the next palindrome\\n\\nPreconditions:\\n    The initial input array represents a palindrome\\n\\nExample\\n    >>> next_palindrome([1,4,9,4,1])\\n    [1,5,0,5,1]\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\"}],\"explanation\":\"原实现从中间向外遍历，在 else 分支中先更新 high_mid/low_mid 再用更新后的指针作为清零区间端点，导致含 9 的内层区间会被漏清或错清，并且镜像位置未在进位时同步更新，产生非回文或错误数值。改为从中心向左遍历寻找第一个可进位位：将该位加一并镜像到对称位置，同时把该位与镜像之间的内层数字全部置 0，保证结果为回文且严格递增。全 9 情况返回 [1]+n个0+[1]（长度 n+2），并同步清零原列表。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"test-development-1\"],\"knowledge_citations\":[\"knowledge-public_tasks\",\"knowledge-testing\"]}",
